          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisa odwoko ni, “Akwoŋere i nyingi Rwoth makwo kodi rin nike akibino weyin.” Ameno jomedere woth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jotuci wac Were piero abic joluwo jo to jocungo bor ye gi jo, aka Elia kodi Elisa jocungo i thengi Malawa Yordan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Elia olunyo kanzu pere to dolo aka ogoyo gine wi pi; pi otiakere aka Elia kodi Elisa joŋado i thenge ca i lowo m'othwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.21.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 21:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo Elia openjo Elisa ni, “Kway gim'imito atim rin mafodi k'okwanyan woko bongin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisa odwoko ni, “Weyi alimi kwoŋ meni perin ma bino miyan lunjo waŋin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
