              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo cwo mogo ma jowok i Yeriko jobino bongi Elisa to jowaco rigo ni, “Paka iŋeyo, jadwoŋ, tindi madwoŋ me ber, to pi mere rac aka kelo ici apodho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.19"
            ]
          }
        }
